<section class="ash-sanctuary" id="the-end" data-ash-sanctuary data-folio-outro data-motion-section aria-labelledby="ash-title">
  <header class="ash-heading">
    <div class="ash-chapter"><span><b aria-hidden="true">&gt;</b> THE LIVING ARCHIVE</span><i></i><span>04 / THE NINE WORLDS</span></div>
    <div class="ash-heading-row">
      <div><p class="ash-eyebrow">AT THE ROOTS OF THE WORLD</p><h2 id="ash-title">YGGDRASIL<span>.</span></h2></div>
      <p class="ash-intro"><span>在世界树的根系间，留一盏灯。</span>拖动，绕行九界；滚轮或双指，靠近这片寒夜。</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="ash-landscape" data-ash-landscape data-awake="false" data-model-state="idle" data-world-module="{{ url_for('js/sanctuary-world.js') }}?v={{ theme.asset_version }}">
    <img class="ash-model-poster" src="{{ url_for('images/yggdrasil-diorama.webp') }}?v={{ theme.asset_version }}" alt="方形遗迹底座上的世界树，九界符文石围绕树根，泉水映着暖光，断桥、石阶和乌鸦隐在寒夜中。" width="1400" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <canvas class="ash-model-canvas" data-ash-canvas tabindex="-1" role="img" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="可旋转的世界树与九界微缩景观" aria-describedby="ash-model-help"></canvas>
  </div>
  <p class="sr-only" id="ash-model-help">鼠标拖拽旋转，滚轮缩放，右键拖拽平移。手机横向拖动旋转，双指缩放，纵向滑动仍可浏览页面。键盘方向键旋转，加减键缩放，空格唤醒九界，R 键复位。也可轻触树心或符文石点亮九界。</p>
  <p class="sr-only" data-ash-status role="status" aria-live="polite">世界树的根系相连，九界静候微光。</p>
  <footer class="ash-colophon"><span>THE ROOTS REMEMBER. THE GARDEN CONTINUES.</span><a href="#hello">回到故事的开头 <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a></footer>
</section>
